sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CompanyPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>DeleteCompanyBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>DeleteCompanyController
  participant StorageService as «control»<br/>StorageService
  participant DesignerCompany as «entity»<br/>DesignerCompany
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: delete my company information
  UI->>B: DELETE /api/designer/company (JWT)
  B->>C: delete(Integer designerId)
  C->>DesignerCompany: delete()
  DesignerCompany->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerCompany: rows
  DesignerCompany-->>C: result
  C->>StorageService: delete()
  StorageService-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result